 "message": "A 12-frame one-shot shield: a small glow flickers on first, the hexagon dome builds up in frames 2-3 and holds at full strength, then it dissolves over the last frames into rising grey smoke puffs and frost sparks. It's a 16-bit look on a transparent background, with the dome in blue and light grey rather than pure pale blue, so the colour may need nudging via the dome colour slider. The dome's see-through, speed and the spark and smoke amounts are on the sliders.",
